# Sidecar ignore (buildx honors <dockerfile>.dockerignore) — keeps the repo-root
# build context light. This runner COPYs only crates/ and server/; the denylist
# below is what stops `docker build .` from tarring the 3.6 GB server/target.
.git
.claude
server/target
**/target
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.log
benchmark-queen
webdoc
app
proxy
clients
examples
assets
helm
helm_queen
